{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "reborn-breadcrumb",
  "title": "面包屑",
  "description": "用于展示当前页面层级路径并可逐级返回的面包屑导航组件，双端可用。",
  "category": "navigation",
  "tags": [
    "navigation",
    "breadcrumb"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web",
    "uniapp"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "separator",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "分隔符",
      "default": "'/'"
    },
    {
      "name": "separatorIcon",
      "type": "any",
      "required": false,
      "description": "图标分隔符的组件或组件名",
      "default": "—"
    },
    {
      "name": "customClass",
      "type": "any",
      "required": false,
      "description": "追加到面包屑根节点的自定义类名",
      "default": "—"
    },
    {
      "name": "ui",
      "type": "any",
      "required": false,
      "description": "细粒度样式覆盖对象，键 root 对应根节点类名",
      "default": "() => ({})"
    },
    {
      "name": "to",
      "type": "string | object",
      "required": false,
      "description": "路由跳转目标，同 vue-router 的 to 属性",
      "default": "—"
    },
    {
      "name": "replace",
      "type": "'navigate' | 'redirect' | 'switchTab' | 'reLaunch'",
      "required": false,
      "description": "导航跳转模式。**Web:** `push`, `replace`, `blank` (新窗口)；**UniApp:** `navigate`, `redirect`, `switchTab`, `reLaunch",
      "default": "'navigate'"
    },
    {
      "name": "target",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "预留的链接打开方式属性：uniapp 端跳转方式由 replace 决定，当前不参与跳转逻辑",
      "default": "—"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "default",
      "description": "自定义默认内容"
    },
    {
      "name": "separator",
      "description": "自定义分隔符内容"
    }
  ],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/reborn-breadcrumb/RebornBreadcrumbDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    },
    {
      "title": "UniApp 演示",
      "path": "packages/uniapp-project/src/pages/reborn-breadcrumb/RebornBreadcrumbDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "uniapp"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "多层级页面结构中提示用户当前位置并支持返回上级。",
    "后台管理、商城分类等需要层级导航的页面头部。",
    "需要自定义分隔符（文本、Iconify 图标或每项独立分隔符插槽）的路径导航。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "平级页签切换场景，改用 reborn-tabs。",
    "分页浏览列表数据，改用 reborn-pagination。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "web 与 uniapp 双端可用，但跳转模式取值不同：Web 为 push/replace/blank（新窗口），UniApp 为 navigate/redirect/switchTab/reLaunch。",
    "条目必须使用配套的 RebornBreadcrumbItem 子组件包裹，跳转目标通过其 to 属性传入。",
    "separator-icon 传入图标名后会覆盖 separator 文本分隔符；也可用 separator 插槽为单项自定义分隔符。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add reborn-breadcrumb"
  },
